OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 18 NOV
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GLeading R&B and soul singer Bilal
OL,12,     Ghas a second bouquet to give out
OL,13,     Gtonight, and this time it goes to
OL,14,     Ga trailblazing jazz pianist that
OL,15,     Ghe has been influenced by.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GBerlin Radio Symphony Orchestra,
OL,18,     Gconductor Clark Rundell and
OL,19,     Gpianist Brad Mehldau perform
OL,20,     Gmusic by Bach and Beethoven and
OL,21,     GMehldau's Piano Concerto
OL,22,     Gdedicated to Herbie Hancock.
